Package: bm
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nishu <nishu@example.com>
Installed-Size: 19
Depends: bash (>= 4.0)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: directory bookmark manager for the command line
 Bookmark directories and quickly jump between them.
 Features:
  * Add named bookmarks for current directory
  * Jump to bookmarked directories
  * List, search, and remove bookmarks
  * Persistent storage in ~/.config/bm/bookmarks
